    "title": "Foggy, chilly start to Friday - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Stephen Cropper ,\n1 hours ago Isolated morning fog is possible, mainly along river valleys, then sunshine and seasonal temperatures return. Isolated morning fog is possible, mainly along river valleys, then sunshine and seasonal temperatures return.\nA slight warm-up is possible this weekend, with highs Sunday near 70.\nTake advantage of this great stretch of weather and catch a glimpse of one of the best fall leaf color shows in recent memory.\nMany areas are near peak or will reach peak fall color within the week.\nDry weather continues and while we could see a shower late next week, it’s also possible we don’t see any rain through the end of the month.\nDownload the FREE WPXI News app for breaking news alerts.\nFollow Channel 11 News on Facebook and Twitter . | Watch WPXI NOW",
